---
manual: edit_box.size_styles
lines: [3006, 3015]
testability: visual
display: native
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  @plain = edit_box
  @sized = edit_box width: 100, height: 100
end
----------- test code
plain = layout_of(edit_box("@plain"))
sized = layout_of(edit_box("@sized"))

assert_in_delta 100, sized.w, 0.5, ":width sets the width"
assert_in_delta 100, sized.h, 0.5, ":height sets the height"
refute_in_delta plain.w, sized.w, 2, "the styled box differs from the default one"
